            "html": "<section class=\"bundle-section\" id=\"bundle\">\n  <p class=\"section-label\">Best value</p>\n  <h2>Both decks.<br><em>One intention.</em></h2>\n  <p class=\"bundle-sub\">One deck for your child to know themselves. One for you to show them you do too.</p>\n  <div class=\"bundle-box reveal\">\n    <div class=\"bundle-imgs\">\n      <img class=\"bundle-img\" src=\"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Product_4.PNG\" alt=\"Mini Moments\">\n      <img class=\"bundle-img\" src=\"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Product_9.PNG\" alt=\"In This Little Life\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bundle-price\">$59 CAD</div>\n    <span class=\"bundle-was\">$70 CAD separately</span>\n    <span class=\"bundle-save\">You save $11 · Free shipping</span>\n    <p class=\"bundle-includes\">Mini Moments · 40 affirmation cards<br>In This Little Life · 40 question cards<br>Ships from Vancouver · Canada & US</p>\n    <a href=\"https://stillnesscuratedretreats.com/?add-to-cart=3184,3189\" class=\"btn-dark\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center;display:block;padding:1.1rem\">Get the bundle — $59 CAD</a>\n    <span class=\"window-warning\">Your child is exactly this age once. This is the season.</span>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n*,*::before,*::after{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\n:root{--stone:#0E1B30;--midnight:#1D3152;--seafoam:#688F9D;--wave:#A4B2BA;--breeze:#D9E8EB;--sand:#C4BBB4;--cream:#F7F0EC;--warm:#F2E8DF;}\n/* Force zero spacing on Elementor parent containers */\n.elementor-widget-container, .elementor-widget-html, .elementor-column-wrap, .elementor-widget-wrap { margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; }\n.bundle-section{padding:7rem 4rem;text-align:center;background:var(--cream);margin:0 !important;}\n.section-label{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif !important;font-size:0.63rem;letter-spacing:0.42em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--seafoam);text-align:center;margin-bottom:1.25rem;display:block}\n.bundle-section h2{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif !important;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.5rem);font-weight:300;color:var(--stone);margin-bottom:0.75rem;line-height:1.1}\n.bundle-section h2 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--seafoam)}\n.bundle-sub{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif !important;font-size:1rem;font-style:italic;color:var(--seafoam);max-width:460px;margin:0 auto 3rem;line-height:1.7}\n.bundle-box{max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--warm);padding:2.5rem;border:0.5px solid rgba(14,27,48,0.1)}\n.bundle-imgs{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1.75rem}\n.bundle-img{width:110px;object-fit:contain;filter:drop-shadow(0 8px 20px rgba(14,27,48,0.1))}\n.bundle-price{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif !important;font-size:3rem;font-weight:300;color:var(--stone)}\n.bundle-was{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif !important;font-size:0.78rem;color:rgba(14,27,48,0.38);text-decoration:line-through;display:block;margin-bottom:0.3rem}\n.bundle-save{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif !important;font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--seafoam);margin-bottom:1.75rem;display:block}\n.bundle-includes{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif !important;font-size:0.83rem;color:rgba(14,27,48,0.55);line-height:2;margin-bottom:1.75rem}\n.window-warning{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif !important;font-size:0.95rem;font-style:italic;color:var(--seafoam);margin-top:1rem;display:block}\n.btn-dark{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif !important;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F7F0EC !important;background:var(--stone);border:none;padding:1rem 2.2rem;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s;text-decoration:none !important;display:inline-block}\n.btn-dark:link,.btn-dark:visited,.btn-dark:hover,.btn-dark:focus,.btn-dark:active{color:#F7F0EC !important;text-decoration:none !important}\n.btn-dark:hover{background:var(--midnight) !important;transform:translateY(-2px)}\n.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);transition:opacity 0.7s ease,transform 0.7s ease}\n.reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}\n@media(max-width:768px){\n.bundle-section{padding:5rem 1.5rem}\n.bundle-imgs{gap:1rem}\n.bundle-img{width:90px}\n}\n</style>\n<script>\nvar observer=new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){entries.forEach(function(e){if(e.isIntersecting)e.target.classList.add('visible')})},{threshold:0.08});\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(function(el){observer.observe(el)});\n</script>"
